Comparison: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2512.11816

1. Qwen will be used, due to its positional embedding being RoPE and not absolute/sinusoidal like in the case of GPT-2
    - Qwen3-0.6B-Base (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B-Base)
    - comparison paper used Qwen2.5-1.5B-Base (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B)

2. For ablation, Qwen Base / Qwen SFT / Qwen SFT + GRPO_comp / Qwen SFT + GRPO_custom will be used

3. Key difference: Variable latent step training
    - comparison paper & coconut uses C steps, where C is pre-defined at the start of training
    - attach a binary classifier to latent head to let it decide when to start/stop generating

4. Training methodology
    1. SFT -> RL(fixed C) -> RL(variable C)
    2. SFT(coconut) -> RL (will try this first)




